meta {
  name: Admin / Organizer - Ensure Organizer Flag
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

patch {
  url: {{base_url}}/rest/v1/profiles?id=eq.{{admin_user_id}}
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  apikey: {{secret_key}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "is_organizer": true
  }
}

script:post-response {
  test("organizer flag ensured (204)", function () {
      expect([204]).to.include(res.status);
  });
}

docs {
  QA19: only the app's own api/organizer-signup route (behind /signup) grants profiles.is_organizer. The Sign Up request above calls GoTrue's /signup directly, so this admin fixture doesn't get the flag from it; this request sets it with the server-only secret key (the only non-SECURITY-DEFINER context allowed to change it). Run it after Sign Up or Log In. Never put the secret key in a tracked file.
}
